@title Cabinet: Autogroup by wiring and heat previews first, names its estimates, Cancel stores nothing, one Undo
@area Cabinet
@sizes 1366x768 1920x1080
# Written without a run (no display on the authoring box): check the pictures on the first run.
# On the made-up heat cabinet (qa/fixtures/heat-place-all.novo, planning values) Place all puts the devices on rails;
# the Arrange card of the Cabinet left rail then has Group by wiring, Group by heat and Group by wiring and heat
# (also Ctrl K: "group by heat", "autogroup wiring"). Each shows a preview banner with its estimates
# ("not a temperature", "an estimate, not a routed length"); Esc stores nothing; Accept is one undo step.
open qa/fixtures/heat-place-all.novo
wait 20
click_text Cabinet #1
wait 20
key ctrl+k
wait 4
text place all
wait 6
key Enter
wait 30
key Enter
wait 20
shot placed
key ctrl+k
wait 4
text group by heat
wait 6
key Enter
wait 20
shot heat-preview
check_layout
key Escape
wait 5
shot heat-cancelled
key ctrl+k
wait 4
text autogroup wiring and heat
wait 6
key Enter
wait 20
shot both-preview
check_layout
key Enter
wait 20
shot both-accepted
check_layout
key ctrl+z
wait 10
shot both-undone
# Refused case: the made-up cabinet has no wires, so Group by wiring says why in words and shows no preview.
key ctrl+k
wait 4
text group by wiring
wait 6
key Enter
wait 20
expect "No wiring between these devices"
shot wiring-refused
